\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Creator Spirit; by whose aid 
\par The world's foundations first were laid;
\par Come, visit every waiting mind,
\par Come, pour Thy joys on human kind;
\par From sin and sorrow set us free,
\par And make Thy temples worthy Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. O Source of uncreated heat,
\par The Father's promised Paraclete,
\par Thrice holy Fount, thrice holy Fire,
\par Our hearts with heavenly love inspire;
\par Come, and Thy sacred unction bring
\par To sanctify us while we sing.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Plenteous of grace, descend from high,
\par Rich in Thy sevenfold energy;
\par Thou strength of His almighty hand 
\par Whose power does heaven and earth command,
\par Refine and purge our earthly parts,
\par And stamp Thine image on our hearts.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Create all new; our wills control,
\par Subdue the rebel in our soul;
\par Make us eternal truths receive,
\par And practice all that we believe;
\par Give us Thyself, that we may see
\par The Father and the Son by Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Immortal honour, endless fame,
\par Attend the almighty Father's name;
\par The Saviour Son be glorified,
\par Who for lost man's redemption died;
\par And equal adoration be,
\par Eternal Comforter, to Thee.\tab 
\par                                Amen.
\par 
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

